  "html": "<article id=\"post-4965\" class=\"container post-4965 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized area-of-service-air-conditioning area-of-service-greenville-sc-cooling type-of-service-diagnostic type-of-service-inspect-repair type-of-service-maintenance\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">The Importance of Factory Fresh A/C Tune-ups</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2021-07-22T15:48:36+00:00\">July 22, 2021</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:07:17+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-Amana-air-conditioning-unit-installed-outside-of-a-building.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"An Amana air conditioning unit installed outside of a building\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/An-Amana-air-conditioning-unit-installed-outside-of-a-building.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/03/An-Amana-air-conditioning-unit-installed-outside-of-a-building-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/An-Amana-air-conditioning-unit-installed-outside-of-a-building-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/An-Amana-air-conditioning-unit-installed-outside-of-a-building-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/An-Amana-air-conditioning-unit-installed-outside-of-a-building-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Now that it’s summer time with hot and humid days you might ask yourself whether your HVAC system is up to the task. Does it need maintenance and tune-up ?</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">And the answer is probably yes. When did you change the filters the last time? Is the refrigerant level correct? Can the outside unit breath and transfer the heat uninhibited to the environment? Overall, is my system as efficient as it can be or do I loose extra money since the system has to work harder than it should?</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here are some tips you can check yourself.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Check the indoor air filter and replace if need. Your blower motor will thank you by using less energy to operate. And as a side effect, you air inside the house will also be cleaner.</li>\n\n<li>Check your outside unit to see whether it’s overgrown by the great bushes you planted years ago. Cut the bushes back at least 2 feet from the unit, to allow the heat pumped to the outside unit ability to escape easier.</li>\n\n<li>Check your thermostat settings to see whether your set temperature meets your comfort need and whether the AC system is running unusually long to accomplish comfort. Unusual run time is a sign to call you HVAC specialist to check further.</li>\n\n<li>Listen for noise, unusual noise that is, since it’s a sign of wear what needs to be taken care of before the system breaks down.</li>\n\n<li>And last but not least you may want to check your power bill and compare to last year. If you see an otherwise unexplained rise in cost, your AC system might be the culprit by not working efficiently any more.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your AC contractor will check many more things during your preventative maintenance visit which is also referred to as System Tune-up.<br></p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to the tips above, a technician will complete the additional tasks below:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Measure and record operating pressures and temperatures. Measure refrigerant super-heat and sub-cooling</li>\n\n<li>Test “temperature drop” at return and supply air</li>\n\n<li>Meter voltage and amperage in all motors</li>\n\n<li>Check blower motor and belt if applicable</li>\n\n<li>Lubricate all moving parts as specified, test for worn bearings</li>\n\n<li>Flush condensate drain to protect against overflow</li>\n\n<li>Inspect start and run capacitors and relays for bulges, rust and leaks which is a sign for immanent failure</li>\n\n<li>Clean outdoor condenser coil</li>\n\n<li>Wash and wax outdoor condenser cabinet</li>\n\n<li>Test condition of compressor contacts, test and tighten wires and connections</li>\n\n<li>And More!</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>You can see the importance of some of the topics and develop the understanding that neglecting your system will end up costing you money due to inefficiency or premature breakdown. Just like your vehicle needs maintenance and an oil change, so does your HVAC unit.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Carolina Heating our technicians are standing by to serve you.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a href=\"/about-us/blog\">Read All Blog Posts</a>\n\t<div class=\"my-4 nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--4-up multi-component-container--uniform-height\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/air-conditioning-installation-costs-greenville-sc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"359\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"An exterior of a building with multiple AC units and flowers\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1024x574.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-300x168.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-768x430.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-1536x861.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers-2048x1148.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Air Condition